  description: '(This card is always treated as an "Enneacraft" card.)

    Once
    per turn, during the End Phase: Remove all E.C. Counters from your field, and
    if you do, your opponent takes 900 damage for each. You can only use each of
    the following effects of "Enneapolis" once per turn. You can target any number
    of "Enneacraft" Pendulum Monster Cards you control; return them to the hand.
    If an "Enneacraft" Pendulum Monster(s) you control is flipped face-up during
    the Main Phase: You can choose 1 of them and either return it to the hand or
    place it in your Pendulum Zone.'
